notes.content:
[h1]Hey Keepers![/h1]

Thank you so much for playing the demo and providing feedback. Here's a small hotfix to improve your demo expierience:

[list]
[*] Changed default audio mix settings;
[*] Changed game icon;
[*] Increased delay between Phineas' cues;
[*] Improved camera settings - movement and rotation sensitivity sliders offer a wider range;
[*] Improved camera logic - camera will no longer move on the edges of the screen when rotating, and mouse movement speeds relative to keyboard have been adjusted;
[*] Fixed ghost exposure reduction not working when they were sent back;
[*] Fixed incorrect movement and rotation camera hotkey icons;
[*] Added pause when minimizing (solves an issue with the audio queue after minimizing it for a while)
[/list]

[h3]Keep scaring![/h3]
